Online medical clinic offering doctor, physiotherapy and dietitian 
consultations via WhatsApp and Google Meet, every day after 5 PM IST.

## Services
- Doctor consultation (₹300): Dr Savan Kukadia, MBBS MD — chronic 
  disease, diabetes, hypertension, thyroid, general medicine
- Physiotherapy (₹300): Dr Roshani Tank, MPT — live online 
  physiotherapy, rehabilitation, pain management, back and joint pain
- Dietitian (₹300, or ₹1,000 for 4 sessions): Dr Roshani Tank — 
  nutrition planning, weight management, diabetes diet, lifestyle

## Contact
Website: https://rrhclinic.in
Email: rehabrecoverhealth@gmail.com
WhatsApp: https://wa.me/919510355464
Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/rehab_recover_health

## Hours
Every day after 5:00 PM IST (Monday to Sunday)

## Location
India (serves patients nationwide via video consultation)</code></pre></div></div></div>
<p dir="ltr"><strong>2. Create <code dir="ltr">og-image.jpg</code></strong> — a 1200×630 px banner image with the clinic name and tagline. Upload it to GitHub repo root so it’s accessible at <code dir="ltr">rrhclinic.in/og-image.jpg</code>. This is what shows when someone shares your link on WhatsApp or social media.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="ms-[calc(var(--cds-assistant-message-text-inset,0px)_-_6px)] print:mt-xs"><div data-cds="MessageActions" data-reveal="fade" role="toolbar" aria-label="Message actions" data-size="xs" tabindex="-1" class="flex items-center select-none [&amp;_button]:text-muted [&amp;_button:hover:not([aria-pressed=true])]:text-primary stacks:[&amp;_button:not(:where([data-cds-theme],[data-cds-theme]_*))]:[--cds-text-muted:var(--cds-fizzy-lake-color-plain-secondary)]!" data-testid="message-actions"><button type="button" data-cds="Button" data-cds-icon-only="" data-cds-ghost="" data-size="xs" class="cds-reset group/btn relative isolate inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap select-none cursor-[var(--cds-cursor-interactive)] aria-disabled:cursor-default data-[disabled]:cursor-default border-0 outline-none focus-visible:outline-hidden [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:outline-hidden h-control font-sans text-body [&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-disabled disabled:pointer-events-none transition-shadow duration-fast text-primary font-normal font-control aria-pressed:text-accent focus-visible:shadow-focus [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:shadow-focus aspect-square w-control px-0 rounded-[calc(var(--cds-radius)+var(--cds-button-radius-add,0px))] stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-100 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:text-button-disabled stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:[--cds-shortcut-cap-ink:currentColor] stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:not-in-data-[cds=SplitDropdownButton]:[--cds-text-button-disabled:var(--cds-fizzy-lake-color-icon-only-disable