.contents&gt;*]:!my-0 print:block print:before:table print:before:-mb-5 print:[&amp;&gt;*]:!mt-5 print:[&amp;&gt;.contents&gt;*]:!mt-5"><div data-transcript-engine-root="" class="contents"><div data-cds="Prose" class="prose stacks:[&amp;_li:not(:where([data-cds-theme],[data-cds-theme]_*))::marker]:[--cds-text-secondary:var(--cds-text-primary)]" style="--_prose-font-body: var(--font-claude-response, var(--cds-font-voice)); --_prose-font-heading-display: var(--_prose-font-heading);"><div data-perf-reply-text="" class="_blocks_4za3l_47 standard-markdown grid-cols-1 grid [&amp;_&gt;_*]:min-w-0 whitespace-normal break-words print:block"><p dir="ltr">To save this as your <code dir="ltr">og-image.jpg</code>:</p>
<ol dir="ltr">
<li><strong>Right-click the image above</strong> → Save image as → save as <code dir="ltr">og-image.jpg</code></li>
<li>Or take a <strong>screenshot</strong> of just the banner and crop to 1200×630 px</li>
<li>Upload it to your <strong>GitHub repo root</strong> so it’s accessible at <code dir="ltr">rrhclinic.in/og-image.jpg</code></li>
</ol>
<p dir="ltr">The banner uses your clinic’s teal colour scheme with the clinic name, tagline, both doctors’ names, pricing, and website URL — exactly what social platforms (WhatsApp, LinkedIn, Twitter) show when someone shares your link.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="ms-[calc(var(--cds-assistant-message-text-inset,0px)_-_6px)] print:mt-xs"><div data-cds="MessageActions" data-reveal="fade" role="toolbar" aria-label="Message actions" data-size="xs" tabindex="-1" class="flex items-center select-none [&amp;_button]:text-muted [&amp;_button:hover:not([aria-pressed=true])]:text-primary stacks:[&amp;_button:not(:where([data-cds-theme],[data-cds-theme]_*))]:[--cds-text-muted:var(--cds-fizzy-lake-color-plain-secondary)]!" data-testid="message-actions" data-always-visible=""><button type="button" data-cds="Button" data-cds-icon-only="" data-cds-ghost="" data-size="xs" class="cds-reset group/btn relative isolate inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap select-none cursor-[var(--cds-cursor-interactive)] aria-disabled:cursor-default data-[disabled]:cursor-default border-0 outline-none focus-visible:outline-hidden [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:outline-hidden h-control font-sans text-body [&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-disabled disabled:pointer-events-none transition-shadow duration-fast text-primary font-normal font-control aria-pressed:text-accent focus-visible:shadow-focus [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:shadow-focus aspect-square w-control px-0 rounded-[calc(var(--cds-radius)+var(--cds-button-radius-add,0px))] stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-100 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:text-button-disabled stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:[--cds-shortcut-cap-ink:currentColor] stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:not-in-data-[cds=SplitDropdownButton]:[--cds-text-button-disabled:var(--cds-fizzy-lake-color-icon-only-disabled)]" aria-label="Copy" id="_r_1bu_" data-base-ui-tooltip-tr